Jeafe
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 26 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 0 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
OR
    SRC Rank K
    SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, CLUBS, SPADES}
DRAW
PILE ALL DRAW Size > 0
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
